{"id": "17-885-2-11", "zh": "整个 ntu 词缀在 aṃ、sa 这些格尾之前，可选地变为 a。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-885-12-18", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词同样表示有定的选择，所以不会过度适用。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-885-19-35", "zh": "satimaṃ、satimantaṃ，bandhumaṃ、bandhumantaṃ，satimassa、satimato、satimantassa，bandhumassa、bandhumato、bandhumantassa，其余相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-886-2-8", "zh": "gacchanta 一词的变化：gacchanta 加 si，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-887-2-9", "zh": "承接“vā”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-888-2-9", "zh": "107. 在 si 之前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-889-2-14", "zh": "gacchanta 等以 anta 词缀结尾的词，其 nta 在 si 格尾之前可选地变为 aṃ 的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-889-15-25", "zh": "经元音省略、si 省略，得到“so gacchaṃ gaṇhāti”，或“gacchanto gaṇhāti”（他边走边拿）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-890-2-12", "zh": "承接“gacchantādīnaṃ”和“ntasaddo”时——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-891-2-7", "zh": "108. 在其余格尾之前视同 ntu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-892-2-16", "zh": "在其余的格尾和词缀之前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 应当视同 ntu 词缀；这是一种作用外推（kāriyātidesa）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-892-17-20", "zh": "其余与 guṇavantu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-893-2-55", "zh": "te gacchanto、gacchantā，bho gacchaṃ、bho gaccha、bho gacchā，bhavanto gacchanto、gacchantā，[gacchaṃ] gacchantaṃ，gacchante，gacchatā、gacchantena，gacchantehi、gacchantebhi，gacchato、gacchantassa，gacchataṃ、gacchantānaṃ，gacchatā、gacchantasmā、gacchantamhā，gacchantehi、gacchantebhi，gacchato、gacchantassa，gacchataṃ、gacchantānaṃ，gacchati、gacchante、gacchantasmiṃ、gacchantamhi，gacchantesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-894-2-11", "zh": "同样还有 mahaṃ、caraṃ、tiṭṭhaṃ，dadaṃ、bhuñjaṃ、suṇaṃ、pacaṃ；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-895-2-11", "zh": "jayaṃ、jīraṃ、cavaṃ、mīyaṃ，saraṃ、kubbaṃ、japaṃ、vajaṃ——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-896-2-3", "zh": "等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-897-2-11", "zh": "bhavanta 一词在 ga、yo、nā、sa 这些格尾上有特殊之处。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-897-12-14", "zh": "so bhavaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-898-2-9", "zh": "承接“bhavato”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-899-2-9", "zh": "109. 在 yo 之前，va 字母有时变为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-900-2-12", "zh": "bhavanta 的 va 字母在 yo 之前有时变为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-900-13-17", "zh": "te bhonto、bhavanto、bhavantā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-901-2-9", "zh": "承接“bhavato”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-902-2-8", "zh": "110. 在 ga 之前则变为 bho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-903-2-9", "zh": "整个 bhavanta 一词在后接 ga 时变为 bho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-903-10-33", "zh": "由 tu 一词，还有 bhante、bhonta 等；省略 ga，得到 bho、bhante、bhonta、bhontā，bhonto、bhavanto、bhavantā，bhavantaṃ，bhonte、bhavante。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-904-2-14", "zh": "在 nā 和 sa 之前，借“obhāvo kvaci”的分句（yogavibhāga）而变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-905-2-10", "zh": "bhotā、bhavatā、bhavantena，bhoto、bhavato、bhavantassa 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-906-2-8", "zh": "111. bhadanta 变为 bhaddanta、bhante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-907-2-16", "zh": "整个 bhadanta 一词在后接 ga 以及 yo 时，有时替换为 bhaddanta、bhante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-907-17-27", "zh": "bho bhaddanta、bhante，或 bhadanta、bhadantā 等等，与 purisa 一词相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-908-2-10", "zh": "112. santa 一词在 bha 之前变为 sa，并在词末增加 ba。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-909-2-17", "zh": "整个 santa 一词在后接 bha 字母时替换为 sa，并在词末增加 ba 字母。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-910-2-12", "zh": "由于取用 ca 一词，在复合词中即使不接 bha 字母，有时也替换为 sa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-910-13-14", "zh": "sabbhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-911-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**bhe**”（在 bha 之前）？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-911-6-11", "zh": "santehi；其余与 gacchanta 一词相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-912-2-22", "zh": "有 rāja、brahma、atta、sakha 等词的变化，同样产生 si 等格尾；在“rāja 加 si”这一状态下——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-913-2-9", "zh": "“brahmattasakharājādito”是管辖项（adhikāra）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-914-2-7", "zh": "113. si 也变为 ā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-915-2-12", "zh": "在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 等词之后，si 格尾变为 ā 字母。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-915-13-18", "zh": "由 ādi 一词，在 ātuma 等词之后也是如此。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-915-19-20", "zh": "经元音省略等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-915-21-23", "zh": "rājā tiṭṭhati（国王站着）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-916-2-6", "zh": "114. yo 变为 āno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-917-2-9", "zh": "在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 等词之后，yo 替换为 āno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-917-10-20", "zh": "rājāno tiṭṭhanti（诸王站着），bho rāja、bho rājā，bhavanto rājāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-918-2-9", "zh": "承接“vā”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-919-2-7", "zh": "115. 在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 等词之后，aṃ 变为 ānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-920-2-9", "zh": "在 brahma 等词之后，aṃ 格尾可选地变为 ānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-920-10-16", "zh": "rājānaṃ passa（看国王），或 rājaṃ；rājāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-921-2-12", "zh": "承接“savibhattissa”和“rājassa”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-922-2-8", "zh": "116. 在 nā 之前可选地变为 raññā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-923-2-13", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词连同格尾，在 nā 格尾之前可选地替换为 raññā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-923-14-18", "zh": "raññā kataṃ（国王所做），或 rājena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-924-2-10", "zh": "117. rāja 在 su、naṃ、hi 之前也变为 rāju。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-925-2-13", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词在 su、naṃ、hi 这些格尾之前替换为 rāju。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-925-14-33", "zh": "ca 一词表示可选；依“sunaṃhisu ca”变为长音，得到 rājūhi、rājūbhi，或 rājehi、rājebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-926-2-9", "zh": "“savibhattissa”是管辖项。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-927-2-8", "zh": "118. rāja 在 sa 之前变为 rañño、rājino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-928-2-13", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词连同格尾，在 sa 格尾之前替换为 rañño、rājino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-928-14-18", "zh": "rañño deti、rājino deti（给国王）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-929-2-9", "zh": "承接“rājassa”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-930-2-9", "zh": "119. 在 naṃ 之前可选地变为 raññaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-931-2-13", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词连同格尾，在 naṃ 格尾之前可选地替换为 raññaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-931-14-17", "zh": "raññaṃ、rājūnaṃ、rājānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-932-2-3", "zh": "在第五格（从格）中——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-933-2-8", "zh": "120. 在 amha、tumha、ntu、rāja、brahma、atta、sakha、satthu、pitu 等之后，smā 视同 nā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-934-2-11", "zh": "在 amha、tumha、ntu、rāja、brahma、atta、sakha、satthu、pitu 等之后，smā 格尾应视同 nā；这是把 smā 格尾外推为 nā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-934-12-15", "zh": "外推（atidesa）则有六种。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-935-2-3", "zh": "如说——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-936-2-9", "zh": "“名称外推、原因外推，同形外推、同性外推；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-937-2-9", "zh": "规则外推以及作用外推，外推共有六种。”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-938-2-8", "zh": "其中在 brahma、atta、sakha 等词中，依据文本的效力，这属于形式外推（rūpātidesa）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-938-9-11", "zh": "其余与第三格相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-939-2-19", "zh": "raññā apeti（离开国王），rājūhi、rājūbhi，rājehi、rājebhi，rañño santakaṃ、rājino santakaṃ（国王的财物），raññaṃ、rājūnaṃ、rājānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-940-2-9", "zh": "承接“rājassa”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-941-2-8", "zh": "121. 在 smiṃ 之前变为 raññe、rājini。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-942-2-13", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词连同格尾，在 smiṃ 格尾之前替换为 raññe、rājini。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-942-14-21", "zh": "raññe patiṭṭhitaṃ、rājini patiṭṭhitaṃ（安立于国王），rājūsu、rājesu。", "confidence": 80}
